      "text": "FastAPI Backend (Python) \u2014 the workhorse\n\n\u00b7 Pipecat voice proxy (D-045)\n\u00b7 LangGraph plan / process / judge\n\u00b7 session engine \u00b7 guard \u00b7 admin API\n\u00b7 payments + activation\n\u00b7 notifier (in-process, no queue)",
